   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Dripping Tap (Live)** (1 other source): Lyric changed to \"Times of our Milwaukee\" and includes a Le Risque quote [2]\n- **God Is Calling Me Back Home (Live)** (1 other source): Last played on June 12, 2015, marking a 580 show gap [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **God Is Calling Me Back Home (Live)**: back after 154 archived shows (3601 days); rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Magenta Mountain (Live)**: back after 38 archived shows (441 days) [4]\n- **Chang'e (Live)**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **Sleep Drifter (Live)**: back after 59 archived shows (547 days) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-09-04.bandcampbootlegger** (recommended): soundboard; 19 songs; 145 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-09-04.ToraTapesMX**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 19 songs; 145 min [2]\n- **kglw2024-09-04.ToraTapesAUD**: source not stated; 19 songs; 145 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Band congratulated Cookie on the Pipe-eye single released the night before [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-09-04.bandcampbootlegger**: taped by Sam Joseph; source: SBD [1]. Also: Recorded by sound crew Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, and Grace King [1]\n- **kglw2024-09-04.ToraTapesMX**: taped by Tora Tapes; Sam Joseph; Joe Santarpia; Grace Reader; Gaspard De Meulemeester; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: Matrix - STEMS (Dropbox) + FOB (Zoom F3 + CA-14) [2]\n- **kglw2024-09-04.ToraTapesAUD**: taped by Tora Tapes; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: FOB (Zoom F3 + CA-14) [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Poster For Tonight Show In Milwaukee Wisconsin At Miller High Life Theatre On Septemb](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-poster-for-tonight-show-in-milwaukee-wisconsin-at-miller-high-life-theatre-on-september-4th-2024-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [5]\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Poster For Tonight Show In Milwaukee Wisconsin At Miller High Life Theatre On Septemb](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-poster-for-tonight-show-in-milwaukee-wisconsin-at-miller-high-life-theatre-on-september-4th-2024-all-over-print-shirt/) [6]\n- Poster by Teesprime: [Original King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Sep 4 2024 Miller High Life Theatre In Milwaukee WI Poster Unisex T Shirt, h](https://teesprime.com/product/original-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-sep-4-2024-miller-high-life-theatre-in-milwaukee-wi-poster-unisex-t-shirt/) [7]\n- Poster by Teesprime: [Original King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Sep 4 2024 Miller High Life Theatre In Milwaukee WI Poster Unisex T Shirt, h](https://teesprime.com/product/original-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-sep-4-2024-miller-high-life-theatre-in-milwaukee-wi-poster-unisex-t-shirt/) [8]",
